WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:02,100
My name is Gong Jie

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,100
Wang Deyang is my husband

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,100
Hello sister-in-law

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,100
You wait a moment

5
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,100
I'll call my brother

6
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,100
Someone is looking for you

7
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,100
Sister-in-law, right?

8
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,520
Hello first time meeting you

9
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,520
Didn't say anything in advance

10
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,520
I'm not disturbing your rest, right?

11
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:17,520
something to drink

12
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,520
no need to bother

13
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,520
I mainly come here to buy things today

14
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,520
The meat that Lao Wang brought back yesterday

15
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,520
tastes really good

16
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,520
Do you have any more here?

17
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,520
Sister-in-law is waiting

18
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:31,580
I'll get it right away

19
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:34,580
You want daddy?

20
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,580
Such a cute kid

21
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,580
Come here and let Auntie give you a hug
